<title>USA: Labor Ready Oct same-store sales rise.</title>
<headline>Labor Ready Oct same-store sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>TACOMA, Wash. 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Labor Ready Inc Monday said sales rose 62 percent last month to $17.4 million from $10.7 million a year ago. Same-store sales for October rose  12 percent.</p>
<p>The company said year-to-date sales through October 1996 rose 71 percent to $126.7 million from $73.9 million for the same period of 1995. Same-store year-to-date sales rose 24 percent over same-store sales for the period last year.</p>
</text>
